<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal investiment funds volume rise six percent.</title>
<headline>Portugal investiment funds volume rise six percent.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese investment funds boosted assets six percent to 2.74 trillion escudos in the year to end September, the Association of Portuguese Fund Management (APFIN) said in a report.</p>
<p>Portfolio investment funds totalled 2.22 trillion, of which bond market investment totalled 1.26 trillion.</p>
<p>Property funds totalled 435 billion escudos, of which 288 billion were in open funds and 147 billion in closed funds.</p>
<p>($1=152.35 escudos)</p>
<p>--Paula Cordeiro, Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
